          <li><strong>Honest Shine Policy:</strong> While vacuum PVD gold is extraordinarily resistant, we reject deceptive marketing claims of "infinite permanent shine." Constant abrasion against coarse abrasive surfaces or concentrated industrial bleach will gradually wear down any micro-coating. Proper care in accordance with our <a href="/jewellery-care" class="text-[#a1505a] font-bold underline">Jewellery Care Guide</a> preserves radiant luster for years.</li>
